Subject: [PATCH 272/289] [ae-patch] Ask whether to pin a lead alone or with
 its whole family, and keep the tree in Pinned

Pinning or unpinning a session that leads a family now asks, in a dialog,
whether to take only the parent or the whole family. Settings > Chat > Pin a
lead's family has three choices: Ask each time (the new default; the old Off
reads as this), Always the whole family (the old On) and Only the parent.
Pinned draws a pinned family as a tree at its lead's pin slot, and dragging
the lead moves the whole family.
